WEBVTT

00:15:59.344 --> 00:16:03.048
the difference between social stimulation
versus just any type of stimulation?

00:16:03.072 --> 00:16:06.303
It seems like some of the earlier
experiments that were done on kids

00:16:06.327 --> 00:16:08.415
were other types
of stimulation, not social,

00:16:08.439 --> 00:16:11.518
but that the kids that reacted strongly
to a noise or whatever,

00:16:11.542 --> 00:16:14.651
often, that was predictive
that they would end up as introverts.

00:16:14.675 --> 00:16:18.485
SC: Yeah. OK. That's such a good question,
and two separate answers to it.

00:16:18.509 --> 00:16:21.714
One is that, in your case
that you just described,

00:16:21.738 --> 00:16:24.981
it could be that you're
such a lover of ideas

00:16:25.005 --> 00:16:28.127
that if we put you into the IMAX theater

00:16:28.151 --> 00:16:30.922
where you're going to learn
something about the universe,